{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>由 Mad Mimic 開發的海盜冒險遊戲 Mark of the Deep，現於 Epic Games 平台<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，支援 Windows，截止時間為 11 月 26 日 23:00（香港/台灣時間）。作品以強烈敘事結合銀河惡魔城式探索與魂系戰鬥元素，玩家將在受詛咒的島嶼上展開冒險。</p>\n<p>玩家扮演海盜劉琦，深入受詛咒的島嶼探索，目標是尋找失蹤的海盜船員。冒險流程圍繞探索相連區域、應付具挑戰性的戰鬥，並在推進中逐步揭開島嶼奧秘；銀河惡魔城與魂系元素分別體現在探索推進與戰鬥壓力上。</p>\n<p>遊戲以海盜冒險為包裝，強調敘事推進，並把探索、戰鬥與尋回船員的目標串連起來；官方簡介亦點出作品混合銀河惡魔城與魂系元素，讓整體冒險兼具探索與緊張戰鬥節奏。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"【PC】深入詛咒島尋失蹤船員 Mark of the Deep 限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1600\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Mark-Of-The-Deep-1lope.jpg\" width=\"1200\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"【PC】深入詛咒島尋失蹤船員 Mark of the Deep 限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1080\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Mark-Of-The-Deep-1k2bg.jpg\" width=\"1920\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"【PC】深入詛咒島尋失蹤船員 Mark of the Deep 限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1080\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Mark-Of-The-Deep-1dac0.jpg\" width=\"1920\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"【PC】深入詛咒島尋失蹤船員 Mark of the Deep 限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1080\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Mark-Of-The-Deep-Een94.jpg\" width=\"1920\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"【PC】深入詛咒島尋失蹤船員 Mark of the Deep 限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1080\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Mark-Of-The-Deep-Iq37n.jpg\" width=\"1920\"/></figure>\n<p>遊戲名稱：Mark of the Deep<br/>支援平台：Windows<br/>領取位置：<a href=\"https://store.epicgames.com/p/mark-of-the-deep-f7dc08?lang=zh-tw\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Epic Games</a></p>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T21:24:06.454751+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":372,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T20:56:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T03:37:36.116283+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T21:17:32.705711+00:00","content_hash":"fc658cd4f23eae680ff280f914dc05dd5e0a465150a0d41a59540e796bd1c61d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}